    },
    "body": "The joint-fragment candidate completes its three trained token phases, then repeats an earlier source token at the next phase. A generic offline typed candidate adapter captures that reached boundary without a serving exception. One native frame and six independent saved-score controls exactly reconstruct the original conditional pool and current actual receipt: both retain the earlier donor and identical Generate scores; the Prefix update worsens the already incorrect Copy margin, while U favors the desired token without restoring it.\n\nRetains source/artifact identities, the reader serialization setup fault and repair, exact controls, reviews and the prospective whole-span/termination credit question. No new learning, candidate promotion, original recapture, capacity or language claim.\n\nValidation: measured-source 18 focused release tests, build, formatting, claim wording and diff checks pass on the approved pod. Exact final-head checks and private preservation receipt will be posted before protected queue admission. Required CI names are compatibility acknowledgements only. References #820.",
